  {
    "id": 1010001000110010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ひゃあっ！？\r\nプ、プロデューサーさん、見ちゃったんですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……サインの練習、してたんです\r\nえへへ、ちょっと恥ずかしいですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なるほど。サインか……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "上手く書けるように\r\nなったか？",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000111"
  },
  {
    "select": "そのノートに\r\n書いていいのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000112"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "その前にレッスンも\r\n頑張ろうな",
    "nextLabel": "1010001000113"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110030,
    "label": "1010001000111",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それがなかなか難しくって！　時間がかかってもダメだし、\r\n雑になっちゃってもダメだし……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "奥が深いんだなってひしひし感じてます……！\r\nもうちょっと練習してみますね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110050,
    "label": "1010001000112",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "大丈夫ですよ！　これ、アイドルについて\r\n勉強したこととかを書くためのノートなので！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……このノート、使うの楽しみなんです。えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110070,
    "label": "1010001000113",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "は、はい！　もちろん忘れてませんよ！\r\nまずはステージを見てくれる人を楽しませなきゃです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001000110080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ごめんなさい、ちょっと先走りすぎちゃいました\r\nこういうのは、やることやってからじゃないと、ですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100011/1010001000110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
